{"id":"abreise","lemma":"Abreise","pos":"noun","rank":4720,"glosses":["departure"],"ipa":"/ˈʔapˌʀaɪ̯zə/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/c/c4/De-at-Abreise.ogg/De-at-Abreise.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Abreise","plural":"Abreisen"},"examples":[{"text":"Sie informierte mich über ihre Abreise.","en":"She informed me of her departure.","words":[{"g":"she / they / you"},{"g":"to inform, to update","l":"informieren"},{"g":"me","l":"ich"},{"g":"[with accusative or…"},{"g":"her","l":"ihr"},null]},{"text":"Ich kann meine Abreise nicht aufschieben.","en":"I can't postpone my departure.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},{"g":"my","l":"mein"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"to push open"}]},{"text":"Wir müssen vor der Abreise noch etwas erledigen.","en":"We still have something to do before we leave.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"to have to"},{"g":"in front of, ahead of"},{"g":"the"},null,{"g":"still / yet"},{"g":"something"},{"g":"to finish"}]},{"text":"Weißt du, warum er seine Abreise verschoben hat?","en":"Do you know why he put off his departure?","words":[{"g":"to know","l":"wissen"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"why"},{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"his","l":"seiner"},null,{"g":"postponed"},{"g":"has","l":"haben"}]},{"text":"Willst du morgen abreisen?","en":"Do you want to leave tomorrow?","words":[{"g":"to want","l":"wollen"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"tomorrow"},null]}]}